---
const certificates = [
  { src: '/images/certificates/slot-01.png', alt: 'SGS Test Report' },
  { src: '/images/certificates/slot-02.png', alt: 'UDEM Low Voltage Directive Attestation of Conformity' },
  { src: '/images/certificates/slot-03.png', alt: 'Bureau Veritas CE Attestation of Conformity' },
  { src: '/images/certificates/slot-04.png', alt: 'Bureau Veritas LCIE CE Attestation of Conformity' },
  { src: '/images/certificates/slot-05.png', alt: 'SAA Certificate of Conformity / Approval' },
  { src: '/images/certificates/slot-06.png', alt: 'ICR Verification of Conformity' },
];
---

<section class="py-14 lg:py-20 bg-white" aria-labelledby="certificate-heading">
  <div class="section-container">
    <h2 id="certificate-heading" class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-brand-900 mb-8">
      Certifications
    </h2>

    <div class="certificate-viewport mx-auto">
      <div class="certificate-track">
        {
          certificates.map((certificate) => (
            <div class="certificate-card">
              <img
                src={certificate.src}
                alt={certificate.alt}
                class="w-full h-full object-contain"
                loading="lazy"
                draggable="false"
              />
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-8 max-w-4xl text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
      Our products have earned prestigious Australian SAA certification, meeting rigorous
      international standards across everything from whole-house electrical systems to overall
      structural integrity. Whether used for commercial campsites or private residences, they
      offer complete peace of mind for both you and your guests.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .certificate-viewport {
    width: 100%;
    container-type: inline-size;
    container-name: cert-viewport;
    --cert-gap: clamp(0.5rem, 1.2cqi, 1rem);
    --cert-visible: 6;
  }

  .certificate-track {
    display: flex;
    width: 100%;
    gap: var(--cert-gap);
  }

  .certificate-card {
    width: calc((100cqi - (var(--cert-visible) - 1) * var(--cert-gap)) / var(--cert-visible));
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 20;
    height: auto;
    flex: none;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgb(209 213 219);
    background: white;
    padding: 0.35rem;
  }
</style>
